cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this book, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Nonlinear Structural Analysis"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23457260
abstract: >-
  An interactive book on matrix methods for nonlinear structural analysis,
  with OpenSeesPy as the computational platform. Each method is developed as
  mechanics, a language-independent algorithm, and a runnable OpenSeesPy
  implementation, from the matrix framework and linear elements through
  material and section nonlinearity, nonlinear solution strategies, geometric
  nonlinearity, and nonlinear dynamics.
authors:
